## Context

Child of epic 0061. `query_frontier.py` accepts `--prompt-modules`
(ticket 0055). `query_rag.py` does not — it takes `--prompt` only.
The RAG ablation regime needs the same 16 prompt variants injected
alongside the corpus.

## Actions

1. Add `--prompt-modules` / `--modules-dir` to `query_rag.py`
   (same pattern as query_frontier.py)
2. When prompt_modules present, call `assemble_prompt()` and prepend
   the assembled text before the RAG corpus context
3. Fallback: existing `--prompt` still works unchanged
4. Test: dry-run RAG with `--prompt-modules persona overview`

## Exit criteria
- `query_rag.py` accepts `--prompt-modules`
- Assembled prompt + RAG corpus combined correctly
- Existing RAG sweeps unchanged
